     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "generated" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap FROrderLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"en-FROrderLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcFROrderLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMOrder.html\">Logical model - FR LM Order</a> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-inFulfillment-of.html\">CDA - inFulfillmentOf</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMOrder.html#s-FRLMOrder\">FRLMOrder</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-inFulfillment-of.html#s-InFulfillmentOf\">InFulfillmentOf</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMOrder.html#s-FRLMOrder.orderDateAndTime\">FRLMOrder.orderDateAndTime</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td colspan=\"5\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">inFulfillmentOf ne référence l'order que par id/accessionNumber, sans porter sa date.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMOrder.html#s-FRLMOrder.orderPlacer[x]\">FRLMOrder.orderPlacer[x]</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td colspan=\"5\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">inFulfillmentOf ne référence l'order que par id/accessionNumber, sans porter son demandeur.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMOrder.html#s-FRLMOrder.orderReason[x]\">FRLMOrder.orderReason[x]</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td colspan=\"5\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">inFulfillmentOf ne référence l'order que par id/accessionNumber, sans porter son motif.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 2 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMOrder.html\">Logical model - FR LM Order</a> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-order.html\">CDA - order</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMOrder.html#s-FRLMOrder.orderId\">FRLMOrder.orderId</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-order.html#s-Order.id\">Order.id</a></td><td>1..*</td><td>todo</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMOrder.html#s-FRLMOrder.accessionNumber\">FRLMOrder.accessionNumber</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td colspan=\"5\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucun champ CDA dédié distinct pour l'accession number dans fr-cda-order (ne porte que Order.id).</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 3 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMOrder.html\">Logical model - FR LM Order</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/servicerequest.html\">ServiceRequest</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Co